Subject: [PATCH] fix(tui): separate thinking visibility and run disclosure
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

沿真实 ReasoningRun/ReasoningBody 适配，保留稳定分组、共享预算、原宽度、
独立 Part 生命周期及常驻正文；不恢复旧 per-Part 重表达。

